        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Stockton%2C_Texas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After railroads bypassed the post, Fort Stockton declined and was abandoned on June 30, 1886.",
